WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.132
An announcement came over the radio.

2
00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:06.355
" Taekuk crew, you are now free to move

3
00:00:06.356 --> 00:00:09.526
around." "Yippee!" shouted

4
00:00:09.527 --> 00:00:11.646
Jinwook. "Jinwook! Stop fooling

5
00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:15.318
around! We have lots of work to do!" Captain Peter

6
00:00:15.319 --> 00:00:18.360
scolded. But this was Jinwook's first time in

7
00:00:18.361 --> 00:00:23.246
space. He was too excited to

8
00:00:23.247 --> 00:00:29.813
work. "Now that we're in space, you can take your pressure suit off," Linda said with a

9
00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:31.881
smile. Jinwook could not believe

10
00:00:31.882 --> 00:00:34.792
it! It was his dream to travel in

11
00:00:34.793 --> 00:00:41.718
space. He was about to begin his space

12
00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:45.810
adventure! Jinwook and the crew worked hard for several

13
00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:50.631
hours. Soon it was time for Jinwook's first meal in

14
00:00:50.632 --> 00:00:53.125
space. "It's not easy to eat in

15
00:00:53.126 --> 00:00:56.641
space. Eating in space takes practice," Adam

16
00:00:56.642 --> 00:01:01.657
said. "What do we eat?" Jinwook

17
00:01:01.658 --> 00:01:08.814
asked. "We can eat just about anything, but the food has to be made into a sticky paste," answered Captain

18
00:01:08.815 --> 00:01:11.314
Peter. Dinner was

19
00:01:11.315 --> 00:01:14.644
spaghetti! Mealtime in space is often

20
00:01:14.645 --> 00:01:17.906
playtime. Adam's favorite trick is playing with his

21
00:01:17.907 --> 00:01:23.439
drinks. In space, water floats in the air in big

22
00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:28.699
drops. "What's this for?" Jinwook pointed to the Velcro on his

23
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:34.354
trousers. "That's Velcro. If we don't hold onto things, everything just floats around in

24
00:01:34.355 --> 00:01:38.449
space. So we use Velcro to hold things down," Adam

25
00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.585
explained. "Even this food tray has Velcro strips

26
00:01:41.586 --> 00:01:46.904
underneath. It can be attached to the wall!

27
00:01:46.905 --> 00:01:51.493
Watch!" "Do we float because there is no gravity in space?" Jinwook

28
00:01:51.494 --> 00:01:56.155
asked. "Gravity? Of course there's gravity," answered

29
00:01:56.156 --> 00:02:03.573
Adam. "But in orbit around Earth, there is very little gravityㅡalmost zeroㅡand you don't feel any weight.

30
00:02:03.574 --> 00:02:06.125
That's why it's so easy to move.

31
00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:10.050
That's why you can float in space.

32
00:02:10.051 --> 00:02:13.912
Look at Captain Peter," said Adam.

33
00:02:13.913 --> 00:02:16.795
"He's running on the exercise machine.

34
00:02:16.796 --> 00:02:21.706
Floating inside the space shuttle, we hardly use our bones and muscles at all.

35
00:02:21.707 --> 00:02:29.392
So to stay healthy, we have to exercise every day," he explained to Jinwook.

36
00:02:29.393 --> 00:02:32.341
"It's bedtime," Captain Peter said.

37
00:02:32.342 --> 00:02:35.064
Adam gave Jinwook a sleeping bag.

38
00:02:35.065 --> 00:02:37.960
"Make sure you attach your sleeping bag to something."

39
00:02:37.961 --> 00:02:44.086
Jinwook nodded, but he was too excited to sleep.

40
00:02:44.087 --> 00:02:47.260
Jinwook stayed up and looked out into space.

41
00:02:47.261 --> 00:02:51.497
"It's so amazing to be in space," he said to himself.

42
00:02:51.498 --> 00:02:56.742
Finally, Jinwook fell into a deep sleep.

43
00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:59.828
Jinwook was having a wonderful dream.

44
00:02:59.829 --> 00:03:03.892
He was telling his family and friends about his space adventure.

45
00:03:03.893 --> 00:03:06.441
"Ouch!" he cried suddenly.

46
00:03:06.442 --> 00:03:12.411
"Jinwook! I told you to attach your sleeping bag to something," said Captain Peter.

47
00:03:12.412 --> 00:03:16.805
"Wake up, Jinwook! Jinwook!"

48
00:03:16.806 --> 00:03:20.523
"Wake up, Jinwook!" his mom was saying.

49
00:03:20.524 --> 00:03:24.294
"Captain?" Jinwook called out sleepily.

50
00:03:24.295 --> 00:03:29.107
"Captain? It's Mom, Jinwook! You're late for school!"

51
00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:36.450
"School? There's no school aboard a spaceship," said Jinwook, waking up.

52
00:03:36.451 --> 00:03:42.909
"Spaceship? You must have been dreaming." His mother laughed.

53
00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.724
Jinwook picked up his book.

54
00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:50.255
"What happened to Captain Peter and Linda and Adam?

55
00:03:50.256 --> 00:03:52.553
Where are my Velcro trousers?"

56
00:03:52.554 --> 00:03:56.471
Jinwook spread his arms out.

57
00:03:56.472 --> 00:04:01.761
"Last night I had my first space adventure," he said excitedly.

58
00:04:01.762 --> 00:04:04.914
"Do you know what I want to be when I grow up?"

59
00:04:04.915 --> 00:04:12.828
"Let me guess—an astronaut?" His mother winked.

